          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115316,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la sintassi per chiamare la funzione <code>.filter()</code> sull'array <code>names</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" T = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(T);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"73\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>names.filter</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115318,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi la dichiarazione della funzione inline e il parametro appropriato per popolare l'array <code>largeOrder</code> usando <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" customerTotals = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" largeOrder = customerTotals.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total &gt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"106\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>function(total)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115319,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esamina i parametri e completa la sintassi in modo che <code>top3</code> memorizzi i primi tre <code>finishers</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"124\" endIndex=\"129\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question",
            "id": 115383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché passiamo una funzione come parametro all'interno di <code>.reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare gli elementi dell'array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> quale array modificare</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> quali elementi includere o escludere</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare gli elementi dell'array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esegui <code>[5, 10, 20].reduce((total, price) =&gt; total + price)</code>. Quale valore produce?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>35</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>30</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[5, 10, 20]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[10, 20, 40]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>35</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la sintassi per chiamare la funzione <code>.reduce()</code> sull'array <code>cookieOrders</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookieOrders = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = cookieOrders.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"75\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"71\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>cookieOrders.reduce</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question",
            "id": 115384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il numero minimo di parametri necessari per far funzionare <code>.reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 2.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una callback che somma <code>prices</code> riceve solo <code>total</code>, quindi non può leggere il prezzo corrente. Qual è la modifica minima?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usa due parametri: il <code>total</code> progressivo e il <code>price</code> corrente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usa tre parametri perché l'indice dell'array è obbligatorio</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mantieni un solo parametro perché <code>total</code> contiene automaticamente il prezzo corrente</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovi tutti i parametri perché <code>.reduce()</code> legge autonomamente entrambi i valori</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usa due parametri: il <code>total</code> progressivo e il <code>price</code> corrente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example",
            "id": 115392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
