            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi una arrow function che accetti due parametri (<code>prev</code> e <code>curr</code>) e restituisca la loro somma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sales = [\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"125\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"465\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salesTotal = sales.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prev + curr);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salesTotal);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sales\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"840\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>prev</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>curr</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna ai parametri i nomi <code>prev</code> e <code>curr</code>, in questo ordine. Crea una arrow function che restituisca la loro somma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sales = [\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"125\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"465\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salesTotal = sales.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prev + curr);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salesTotal);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prev - curr\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prev * curr\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sales\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"840\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>prev</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>curr</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>",
